<title>BELGIUM: EU wheat tax rule to be published between May 5-7.</title>
<headline>EU wheat tax rule to be published between May 5-7.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A regulation bringing into force an EU tax on exports of soft wheat is likely to be published in the European Union Official Journal between May 5-7, a European Commission official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We cannot give an exact date but it's likely to be between May 5-7,&quot; an official said.</p>
<p>Following last Thursday's decision to impose a 15 ecus a tonne tax on daily exports of soft wheat grain, no applications for wheat export licences would be approved, the official added.</p>
<p>Exporters, who took out a nil value export licence beforehand, will be liable to tax if they haven't customs cleared their exports before the regulation becomes effective.</p>
<p>-Brussels Bureau +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
